milligrams per liter at entry points and at least 0.2 mg/L in distribution. Entry and distribution thresholds are different controls.\nFilter media, coagulant dose, source-water blend, contact time, or UV configuration changes stale prior treatment verification.\n\n## Governing relationships\n\nGARNET source-water findings set FALCON treatment assumptions. BASTION residence time and CIPHER sampling determine whether treated water evidence applies downstream.\nDELTA demand ramps cannot outrun FALCON verified capacity or required disinfectant contact time.\n\n## Operational evidence\n\n| record | asset/zone | version | measure | unit | status |\n|---|---|---|---:|---|---|\n| TRT-000 | clarifier | v2 | 0.2 | ntu | superseded |\n| TRT-001 | filter-bank | v2 | 1.5 | ntu | current |\n| TRT-002 | chlorine-contact | v2 | 2.8 | ntu | current |\n| TRT-003 | uv-train | v2 | 1.0 | ntu | current |\n| TRT-004 | clarifier | v2 | 2.3 | ntu | current |\n| TRT-005 | filter-bank | v2 | 0.5 | ntu | current |\n| TRT-006 | chlorine-contact | v2 | 1.8 | ntu | current |\n| TRT-007 | uv-train | v2 | 3.1 | ntu | current |\n| TRT-008 | clarifier | v2 | 1.3 | ntu | current |\n| TRT-009 | filter-bank | v2 | 2.6 | ntu | current |\n| TRT-010 | chlorine-contact | v2 | 0.8 | ntu | current |\n| TRT-011 | uv-train | v2 | 2.1 | ntu | current |\n| TRT-012 | clarifier | v2 | 0.3 | ntu | current |\n| TRT-013 | filter-bank | v2 | 1.6 | ntu | current |\n| TRT-014 | chlorine-contact | v3 | 2.9 | ntu | current |\n| TRT-015 | uv-train | v3 | 1.1 | ntu | current |\n| TRT-016 | clarifier | v3 | 2.4 | ntu | current |\n| TRT-017 | filter-bank | v3 | 0.6 | ntu | current |\n| TRT-018 | chlorine-contact | v3 | 1.9 | ntu | current |\n| TRT-019 | uv-train | v3 | 3.2 | ntu | superseded |\n| TRT-020 | clarifier | v3 | 1.4 | ntu | current |\n| TRT-021 | filter-bank | v3 | 2.7 | ntu | current |\n| TRT-022 | chlorine-contact | v3 | 0.9 | ntu | current |\n| TRT-023 | uv-train | v3 | 2.2 | ntu | current |\n| TRT-024 | clarif